{"suttaId":"thi-ap14","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[7047,7117],"vripara":"37"},"segments":{"thi-ap14:0.3":"Ekāsanadāyikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap14:1.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, ahosiṃ bālikā [mālikā (syā. pī.)] tadā;","thi-ap14:1.3":"Mātā ca me pitā ceva, kammantaṃ agamaṃsu te.","thi-ap14:2.1":"“Majjhanhikamhi sūriye, addasaṃ samaṇaṃ ahaṃ;","thi-ap14:2.3":"Vīthiyā anugacchantaṃ, āsanaṃ paññapesahaṃ.","thi-ap14:3.1":"“Gonakāvikatikāhi [gonakacittakādīhi (sī.)], paññapetvā mamāsanaṃ;","thi-ap14:3.3":"Pasannacittā sumanā, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","thi-ap14:4.1":"“‘Santattā kuthitā bhūmi, sūro majjhanhike ṭhito;","thi-ap14:4.3":"Mālutā ca na vāyanti, kālo cevettha mehiti [cettha upaṭṭhito (sī.), cevatthaṃ eti taṃ (pī.)].","thi-ap14:5.1":"“‘Paññattamāsanamidaṃ, tavatthāya mahāmuni;","thi-ap14:5.3":"Anukampaṃ upādāya, nisīda mama āsane’.","thi-ap14:6.1":"“Nisīdi tattha samaṇo, sudanto suddhamānaso;","thi-ap14:6.3":"Tassa pattaṃ gahetvāna, yathārandhaṃ adāsahaṃ.","thi-ap14:7.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap14:7.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap14:8.1":"“Tattha me sukataṃ byamhaṃ, āsanena sunimmitaṃ;","thi-ap14:8.3":"Saṭṭhiyojanamubbedhaṃ, tiṃsayojanavitthataṃ.","thi-ap14:9.1":"“Soṇṇamayā maṇimayā, athopi phalikāmayā;","thi-ap14:9.3":"Lohitaṅgamayā ceva, pallaṅkā vividhā mama.","thi-ap14:10.1":"“Tūlikā vikatikāhi, kaṭṭissacittakāhi ca;","thi-ap14:10.3":"Uddaekantalomī ca, pallaṅkā me susaṇṭhitā [susanthatā (sī.)].","thi-ap14:11.1":"“Yadā icchāmi gamanaṃ, hāsakhiḍḍasamappitā;","thi-ap14:11.3":"Saha pallaṅkaseṭṭhena, gacchāmi mama patthitaṃ.","thi-ap14:12.1":"“Asīti devarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap14:12.3":"Sattati cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap14:13.1":"“Bhavābhave saṃsarantī, mahābhogaṃ labhāmahaṃ;","thi-ap14:13.3":"Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ [ekāsanaphalaṃ idaṃ (sabbattha) evamuparipi].","thi-ap14:14.1":"“Duve bhave saṃsarāmi, devatte atha mānuse;","thi-ap14:14.3":"Aññe bhave na jānāmi, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap14:15.1":"“Duve kule pajāyāmi, khattiye cāpi brāhmaṇe;","thi-ap14:15.3":"Uccākulīnā [uccākulikā (syā. pī. ka.)] sabbattha, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap14:16.1":"“Domanassaṃ na jānāmi, cittasantāpanaṃ mama;","thi-ap14:16.3":"Vevaṇṇiyaṃ na jānāmi, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap14:17.1":"“Dhātiyo maṃ upaṭṭhanti, khujjā celāpikā [khelāpikā (sī.), celāvikā (pī.)] bahū;","thi-ap14:17.3":"Aṅkena aṅkaṃ gacchāmi, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap14:18.1":"“Aññā nhāpenti bhojenti, aññā ramenti maṃ sadā;","thi-ap14:18.3":"Aññā gandhaṃ vilimpanti, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ [aññā mameva nhāpenti, aññā bhojenti bhojanaṃ; aññā maṃ alaṅkaronti, aññā ramenti maṃ saddhā;(syā.)].","thi-ap14:19.1":"“Maṇḍape rukkhamūle vā, suññāgāre vasantiyā;","thi-ap14:19.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, pallaṅko upatiṭṭhati.","thi-ap14:20.1":"“Ayaṃ pacchimako mayhaṃ, carimo vattate bhavo;","thi-ap14:20.3":"Ajjāpi rajjaṃ chaḍḍetvā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap14:21.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap14:21.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ekāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap14:22.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap14:23.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap14:24.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap14:25.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ ekāsanadāyikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap14:26.1":"Ekāsanadāyikātheriyāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
